    <briefdescription>
<para>Receives debug output from dbgeng: the target&apos;s console text and the engine&apos;s own text. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Registered with IDebugClient5::SetOutputCallbacks. Implements IDebugOutputCallbacks2, and its GetInterestMask requests DEBUG_OUTCBI_ANY_FORMAT, so dbgeng calls Output2. Output2 fires <ref refid="namespaceId_1adea1a2ab6acf45850b174d29a4f50ed2" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">Id::console</ref> on <ref refid="classdebug_1_1_session_1a81f6eec8b52b3becaada99d133d8840f" kindref="member">Session::events</ref> for text that carries the DEBUG_OUTPUT_DEBUGGEE mask bit.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Owned by <ref refid="classdebug_1_1_session" kindref="compound">Session</ref> as a member. setDebugInterfaces registers it, and shutdown unregisters it. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
